  "question": {
    "text": "The Total pressure observed by mixing two liquid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>350</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math> when their mole fractions are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math> respectively.&nbsp;The Total pressure becomes<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>410</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math> if the mole fractions are changed to<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></math> respectively for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>. The vapour pressure of pure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is ______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math>. (Nearest integer) Consider the liquids and solutions behave ideally"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "314",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let Vapour pressure&nbsp;of pure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p>Let Vapour pressure&nbsp;of pure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p>Using Raoult&#39;s law and Dalton&#39;s law:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>When</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>350</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>350</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>When</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>410</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>350</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>Solving</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>434</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p>"
  }
